{"server":"en","storyId":"story_fmout_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_fmout_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"'Divination'","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"Interlude","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_fmout_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"ceb1c47d24f027a9ef63abb8b14edb6788e26acf5d2b8b20e01b4650879a9004","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"个人剧情 远山"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"Weekend\nRhodes Island Cafeteria"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"And so, just like that—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"And your cards naturally fall like water from one hand—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Into the other."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"Wow!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you know how?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"I still don't!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"Do it again, Gitano!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"*clears throat* Now, watch carefully."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"Okay—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"Wow!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you understand now?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"Nooope—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Really?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Regrettably, however, that's the end of today's cardistry lesson."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"Awww—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"How about one more time?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Then the person teaching here in a short while will be quite angry with me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"You wouldn't want to see me get castigated, would you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"Just one more, one little bit more? It'll be okay, right?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Rules are very important. You cannot let your desires lead you to willingly abandon them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Such as it is, I'll give you all some homework."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"If anyone can show us the fruits of their practice by next week's lesson..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Then—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"You may draw one reward from the teacher's Treasure Chest."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"The Treasure Chest?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"Really?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Really and truly. Just two days ago, your teacher even added something quite fun to it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"As long as you can summon the courage to give us all a display, everyone will get a share."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"Yay!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Alright, class dismissed. Don't forget, keep your cards and toys safe with you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll meet next week."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"Bye, Miss!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Phew..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Phewie and a half. Breathe easy, miss. Lessons still runnin' slick?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"You might get the impression they're lessons, but it's really just entertaining the children."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"You have the greater burden."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"It takes quite a lot of brainpower and effort, teaching children the rules of arithmetic."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Ain't no nightmare, really. Play numbers long 'nuff 'n they get it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"'n what I teach ain't no mathematics. Umm, what was that name I picked it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"'Business Fanatics Class?' Somethin' like that."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Aw, shucks, I'm just the same as you. Three cheers fer fun 'n none fer learnin'."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"And that's quite good."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"After all, it's a very cruel thing, doing business."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"You get me, ma'am."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Though it was never originally intended as such, divination is also fundamentally a sort of business."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"So it goes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll let you set up the classroom in peace, then. Farewell."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Hrmmm—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm?"},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成吃惊"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, right!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Gitano, one second, please!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you need anything?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"It's like this, see. Doctor seems fixin' ta head out far with Gavial, makin' fer a corner of Sargon."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm-hm."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"And me, I'm gettin' ready to visit with, see if I can't do a li'l dealin' while I'm there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, I follow."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"So I thought, uh. Y'see, uh. If you could juuuuust do me a li'l favor, gimme a tellin'?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"You ought to know—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"I know there is, yep, just, urm, how do I break this—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Spent all my money on gettin' stock in, ha, and now I ain't got a red cent on me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"*Sigh*."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"I won't take any money as compensation."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Ya serious? That's mighty fine!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"But I will need you to promise something."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"You must promise me this—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"You will not sell anything to the children during class."},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成吃惊"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Not even if it's 'just snacks.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Uh, haha."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Aw, heck, what makes you think I'd do somethin' like that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Class might be a circus, but I still teach 'em proper."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"You might, you might not. Neither has any bearing on me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"I simply need your promise, and that will be my price."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"'n if I go back on it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Who knows?"},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成懊恼"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"What do you think?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Sold!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"I have accepted your payment."},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成吃惊"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"No need fer a... contract or somesuch?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Our agreement is built upon our trust in each other. We need no contract."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"In that case, let us begin."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Considering class is about to start, we'll employ a more simple divination method."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"(Pulls out tarot deck)"},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成吃惊"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Whoa, that's... some crafts, ain't it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Feels like every card in there'd fetch big money."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Way you spread out 'n spin' 'em on the table, is that shufflin'?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes. Please wait a moment."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Could just shuffle 'em fancy in one shot, like you were teachin'."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Some diviners will do it like that, true."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"But it's too harmful to the cards."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Just like the voyager pushing stubbornly through a blizzard: no matter how healthy, or how warm the clothes, their warmth is pulled away trace by trace in the end."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"The moment warmth is lost, all remedy will be of avail no more."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Ahaha..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Just a comparison Sami tend to use fairly often. I imagine you comprehend it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Yup, yup, I getcha."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"All ready now?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm. They're ready. They should be able to shine a light for you on some of your conundrums."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Gather them together, cut them once, and starting from where you've cut them, lay down three cards."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Remember, do not turn them over yet."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"So ya don't actually do a darn thing, Gitano?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm merely your guide in understanding. Shouldn't you uncover your own fate?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Or, perhaps, you're easily willing to lay your fate in others' hands?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Alrght, I get it now. Lemme at 'em!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Stack 'em up... cut... lay three cards face down in front."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"That oughta be good, right?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Your movements are very direct. It seems you are not adrift."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Darn tootin'."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Well, then. Please."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Turn a card however you wish."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Ya been so dead serious all this time. Got some pressure on me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"There's nothing to be scared of. Come."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Reveal your first card."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"(Flips card)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"The Knight of Cups, Reversed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Ya gotta fill me in. Does forward or backward matter anythin'?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"To put it simply, reversed cards symbolize that you are currently hindered by something."},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成吃惊"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Relax. These hindrances are not necessarily bad in meaning."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"They simply mean that right now, you are unable to successfully proceed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Breakthrough, and success, perhaps aren't too far away."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Gotcha."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Let me look carefully."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Have you run into any problems doing business?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Uh, suppose I have."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"That's how it goes more or less every month. Sometimes I blunder decidin', 'n then I don't earn nothin.' Pain in my keister."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"You've probably seen an opportunity, but failed to grasp it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"That's the story of anyone doin' business any day of the week."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"So this time, you've prepared to stake it all?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"I trust my intuition. Headin' to Gavial's ol' place is gonna pay off big!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"I see."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"By my understanding, Rhodes Island's procurement services have always been short of hands. As long as you're willing to help them with some work, money won't be a problem, and most risk will be shouldered by Rhodes Island instead."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Why choose to go it alone?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"That, huh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Used to workin' by myself."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"It seems your decisions are not wholly profit-seeking."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Ain't as grand as ya put it, neither. Just seein' the world fer myself, makin' some money on the side to patch up expenses."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Always gotta spend money fer the good stuff, after all."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"I understand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"So this, uh, this here card, basically, it ain't no good sign."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Coming events will not be smooth."},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成吃惊"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"So can I just—Gitano—ya gotta teach me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't rush. This is merely a beginning."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Come. Reveal your second card."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"D'awwwgh, alright..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"(Shakes as she flips a card)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"The Ace of Wands, Upright."},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成吃惊"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Wh... what's this one mean...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"You have seized an opportunity, and are about to receive an advantage in life from it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Though there may be great danger, you have issued your challenge to life with full conviction."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Sounds like a good thing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"When I divined for myself, I once came to this one too."},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成吃惊"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Whoa—y'all can even do divination fer yerselves?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"When a flash of miraculous light strikes, diviners are utterly capable of peering into their own paths."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"'n here I thought diviners only took money 'n did stuff fer other folk."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Ultimately, currency cannot settle all questions."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Moreover, there are some paths outsiders have no recourse to interfere in. Only by conversing with themselves, feeling through things, pursuing, can they grasp a chance at a clue."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Gets pretty darn complicated, then."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"It's just like how you choose to conduct business by yourself, Croissant. All your decisions, any of your choices, they're all crystallizations of your years of business experience, aren't they?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Others can only give suggestions. The power to decide lies eternally in your own hand—just as it does now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Even if all three cards portended the worst outcome, would you really change your decisions?"},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成懊恼"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Money's spent..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"So you've only come seeking a comfort of sorts, hoping I might give you reassuring results."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah—no need to answer me. Many are like that. I understand it very well."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"All of us will tend to hope for something unrealistic in uncertain times, something that'll resolve it all."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Unfortunately, I'm not what you've all been hoping for."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"All I can do is peer shallow into the road ahead, and offer all the help I can."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"You've paid my terms, and so I have a responsibility to spare no effort for you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Only this, and nothing more."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Gitano..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Let us continue."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Al... Alrighty."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"You will have an adventure, but it seems your journey won't be serene."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"As for the outcome, we may look to the last card to show our answer."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't say whether there'll even be a single note of LMD at the end."},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成吃惊"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"It just keeps gettin' more dangerous..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"I only bring up a poorer kind of possibility."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Returning with overflowing riches is not out of possibility's realm, either."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Gosh, could ya imagine?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll be visiting Perfumer's sometime for a complete course of aromatic sleep therapy, then."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll leave the bill to you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"I make some cash 'n I'll cover ya!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm-hmm. It's a done deal."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Now, then, let us explore your destination in this journey."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Your final card, please."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"(Flips tarot card with a swish)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"The Moons, Upright."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"So it's upright. 'kay, good start."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"This is... certainly hard to say."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Have... you ever looked into Gavial's hometown situation before?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"I've surveyed Sargon markets before. This stuff'll sell like hotcakes!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"If so, that'll be the best outcome."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"(Is there any possibility it won't be an ordinary Sargon market, I wonder...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"(The Moons upright...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Your journey will not be serene. The fore cards tell of that much."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Be wary of deception, and wary of being cheated."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"In my view, if possible, do proceed cautiously."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you like the moons?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Like? Can't say I do fer sure? But when I'm moody out on the deck 'n look up 'n see the moons, that makes me feel alright some."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"And the moonshadow?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Umm. Do folk specifically go lookin' fer the shadow?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Under the radiance of the moon, things often come to be ignored."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"The things this card shows are also as such."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"There is always that which is hidden by radiance, painstakingly concealed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Whether it is fortune or sorrow requires your own careful consideration."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Noted. I'll be watchin' out."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"And this should be what these cards have shown."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"What these three cards together make known to you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Croissant, your future will not be relaxed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"At the least, accompanying the Doctor on this journey out, there will be many hindrances."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you have any such feeling of your own? For example, a vague unease or confusion in your heart."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Kinda a li'l bit..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"But push past, 'n I should be able to get over it."},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成吃惊"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Do the, uh, cards say I'm gonna lose my investment?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Not at all. Besides, the tarot never speaks in certainties of futures."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"So, still a chance I'm saved."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"If I can't hold out, I oughta last 'nother couple days knockin' on my savin's jar."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Here's hoping."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"As for divining, things would wrap up here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Is there anything else you need me for?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Gitano, you pull a card too!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Didn'tcha just say diviners can divine themselves too?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"I wanna see how yer luck is."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"But that requires me to prepare—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"C'mon, lessee."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"The tarot is not—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Aw, potayto potahto, c'mon. Draw."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"(Draws a card 'for' Gitano.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Come on. Flip it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait. Let me prepare a moment."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Phew."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"(Flips tarot card)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Ten of Cups... Reversed..."},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成吃惊"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"This mean somethin' bad?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Then lemme just turn it round—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Stay your hand and do not touch the card!"},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成吃惊"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, alright..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry, Gitano."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"No."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"That's not it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"The card's position is in relation to the revealer."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"So this card."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Is Upright."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Ohh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Right! Yer sittin' opposite me!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"So this card mean somethin' good, then?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"In regards to my occupation and personal relations, it's not bad at all."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Then—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"(Grabs Gitano's hand and rubs it a few times)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Eh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Lemme borrow a li'l bit of yer good luck, a'ight? This way I can pay ya back."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"If you so insist..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"As you wish, then..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Hoooo boy, yer gonna let me pay you back sure as sweeeeeet heck."},{"type":"narration","text":"//此处替换成吃惊"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"What's wrong?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"I just thoughta somethin'!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"If I'm borrowin' yer good luck, don't that mean the whole divination we just did don't count fer nothin' now?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Who knows?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"So there ain't no rule like that, huh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"If you want another divination, you will have to make a payment to me again."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Uh, yup. Pass, then."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Lemme rub a few more times. That oughta be free, right?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm-hmm~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll give you a discount on this one. Free it is."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Aw, thanks!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"narration","text":"Five minutes later..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"Hi, Croissant!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Young Studying Operator","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"It's nice to meet you too, Gitano!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Oooh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Good day, all."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Well, then. I'll be leaving now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"I pray the LMD you earn will be enough to cram Rhodes Island full."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"You got it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Next time ya got stuff to buy, remember, you find me. I'll give ya some deep discounts!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"Fate is a thing of constant change. We'll talk details when the time is right."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"(Waves and leaves)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gitano","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"(I hope my fortune can truly be of help to you, Croissant.)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_109_fmout","aliases":["Gitano"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["Croissant"]}]}
